        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 utils: add kunit test for ec_split_stripes",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 utils: add kunit test for ec_split_stripes\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/ec_split_test.c for ec_split_stripes(), a pure\nstatic inline helper in lustre_user.h that splits a stripe count into\none or two equally-sized bucket sets for EC data/parity grouping.\nCovers totals below EC_MIN_SPLIT_SIZE, evenly divisible totals (with\nand without an extra bucket needed), the general two-bucket-size case\n(including the 15/7 example from the function's doc comment), and a\nsuggested size of 1, each checking the invariant esc_k0 * esc_n0 +\nesc_k1 * esc_n1 == total.\n\nRun from sanity test_51m, loading kunit on the MDS with enable=1.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5\nChange-Id: Ie52c51403b40867bf3cf47e9f40718a7857f267a\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
